# Example environment file. The real file is /etc/prismotr/prismotr.env, written by
# ansible-hosts and optional: it holds no secret, only the one setting below, and the service
# starts without it.

# The loopback address the daemon serves on, host:port. Leave it out unless the host's
# default port, 8100, is taken; nginx is what faces the network.
# PRISMOTR_LISTEN=
